'''Paldean Wooper''' (Japanese: '''パルデアウパー''' ''Paldean Upah'') is a {{ct|Darkness}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Shining Revelry}} expansion.

